WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.224
This was the strongest path in this branch.

00:00:03.224 --> 00:00:09.285
Javi didn't tell Maya what to do – he asked her what
she actually wanted, and she answered it herself.

00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:13.138
That's important, because Maya won't always have someone
there to nudge her.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:18.039
She found the answer on her own: she wants to walk
in feeling ready, not like she's already behind.

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:19.454
That's a good instinct.

00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:25.147
Orientation is where you meet the people, learn how
the place runs, and pick up the things that aren't

00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:30.522
written in any handbook – which team actually makes
decisions, what the unwritten rules are, who to go

00:00:30.522 --> 00:00:32.171
to when something goes wrong.

00:00:32.171 --> 00:00:33.842
You only get one first day.

00:00:35.043 --> 00:00:37.121
Showing up clear makes a difference.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:41.962
The information pack is still on the table – worth
a look before the pizza arrives.